T 10 db  30 56 Belyer Asu
T 10 db  30 57           _
T 11 buf 112 150 You couldn't possibly have guessed this day would differ from any other.
T 11 buf 100 165 It began just as always. You woke up at dawn and drove off the giant spider
T 11 buf 104 180 resting on your face. On your way to work you had serious trouble avoiding
T 11 buf 100 195 the lions and pythons roaming wild around the village. After getting kicked
T 11 buf 104 210 by colony masters for being late you performed your twelve-hour routine of
T 11 buf 92 225 climbing trees, gathering bananas, climbing trees, gathering bananas, chasing
T 11 buf 88 240 monkeys that stole the first gathered bananas, carrying bananas to the village
T 11 buf 176 255 and trying to look happy when real food was distributed.
T 11 buf 100 285 Finally you were about to enjoy your free time by taking a quick dip in the
T 11 buf 112 300 nearby crocodile bay. However, at this point something unusual happened.
T 11 buf 128 315 You were summoned to the mansion of Richel Decos, the viceroy of the
T 11 buf 252 330 colony, and were led directly to him.
T 18 buf 124 105 "I have a task for you, citizen", said the viceroy picking his golden
T 18 buf 124 120 teeth, "The market price of bananas has taken a deep dive and yet the
T 18 buf 116 135 central government is about to raise taxes. I have sent appeals to high
T 18 buf 116 150 priest Petrus but received no response. I fear my enemies in Attnam are
T 18 buf 112 165 plotting against me and intercepting my messages before they reach him!"
T 18 buf 120 195 "That is why you must travel to Attnam with a letter I'll give you and
T 18 buf 120 210 deliver it to Petrus directly. Alas, you somehow have to cross the sea
T 18 buf 112 225 between. Because it's winter, all Attnamese ships are trapped by ice and
T 18 buf 100 240 I have none. Therefore you must venture through the small underwater tunnel
T 18 buf 112 255 connecting our islands. It is infested with monsters, but since you have
T 18 buf 120 270 stayed alive here so long, the trip will surely cause you no trouble."
T 18 buf 136 300 You have never been so happy! According to the mansion's traveling
T 18 buf 120 315 brochures, Attnam is a peaceful but bustling world city on a beautiful
T 18 buf 116 330 snowy fell surrounded by frozen lakes glittering in the arctic sun just
T 18 buf 112 345 like the diamonds of the imperial treasury. Not that you would believe a
T 18 buf 124 360 word. The point is that tomorrow you can finally forget your home and
T 18 buf 268 375 face the untold adventures ahead.
